":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-1z","agent_clan_generation":"20260910141433","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-1z.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-1z[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Capture-driven Obsidian task status toggle (@route+block-id with no[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]other text)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Submitting a capture draft that is exactly `@route+block-id` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](optionally `@route+block-id#pomodoro`) toggles that existing [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian task between Ready `[ ]` and Next `[*]` and adds or [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]removes its Pomodoro task link, matching the Obsidian [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`<ctrl+shift+enter>` keymap's semantics. The `@route+block-id` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]completion and Add block ID prompt behave exactly as they already [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]do for sub-bullet capture, and Bob Mac Capture makes the mode, the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]target task, and the exact before/after change obvious before the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]user commits it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]capture_task_toggle.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Capture grammar and completion for the task-toggle item[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add the `task_toggle` item mode to the shared capture grammar, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-point `#` after `@route+id` at Pomodoro names while the item has no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]text, add the three `task_toggle_*` span kinds, and route completion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accordingly.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure toggle planners for the route note and the daily ledger[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: add a new native module of pure, unit-tested planners that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compute the route-note task mutation (status, future-schedule [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pull-forward, Schedule Log entry) and the daily-note Pomodoro task-link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]insertion, cleanup, and removal.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Wire the toggle into bob capture, its JSON contract, and its [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]human output[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar, engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture: execute `task_toggle` items inside the existing staged batch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planner, emit the additive JSON fields, render the human before/after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output, and cover the whole surface with CLI integration tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli documentation for the task-toggle marker[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-docs: document the toggle marker, its semantics, its errors, and its[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON in docs/capture.md and README.md, including the `#` mode-dependency[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rule.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CaptureCore models, presentation model, and panel wiring[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-core: decode the additive toggle fields in CaptureCore, add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Linux-testable toggle presentation model, and route completion, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer verb, status text, announcements, and notifications through it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture toggle preview, highlighting, and [/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-preview: render the before/after toggle preview and destination [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail, color the new `task_toggle_*` spans, and document the flow in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the app README.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-1z","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-1z.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-12314e3983da7f89b65d4a13c0f314df","started_at":"2026-09-10T18:15:27.417839+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"6d5ecc92f590e539a9b58dd999330f6c5a9583687ce559612f4524c52be80404","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1z.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"3e4f7116b4a28028091a0748a4359ee55a75fb2b81d513c19f2f9bc50f6f9abd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1z.land/meta.json","size_bytes":647},"prompt":{"digest":"b1474c673609bddab95412e7d17262df25248029b4f46e8fc5728825129af720","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1z.land/prompt.m